'''Ranger [[Tyrian armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign, but which is also available in the Factions campaign and Eye of the North expansion. The armor is labelled as '''Tyrian''' armor when the armor provides 70 armor rating, otherwise it is called '''Leather''' armor.

'''Note''': Ranger Tyrian armor does not have headgear, but [[Ranger Tamer Mask]] and [[Ranger Traveler Mask]] are available from the same crafter in Factions and Eye of the North. Pictures and crafting details are available on those pages.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Tyrian armor.

